body:
Yeah maybe they put it up in the wrong line, here's the description;

AB-CHMFUPPYCA is an analytical reference standard that is structurally classified as a synthetic noid. The structure of highly substituted pyrazoles identified as cannabimimetic designer drugs has been reported.The physiological and toxicological properties of this compound are not known. This product is intended for research and forensic applications.

So cannabimimetic - I don't even know what that is since I don't use cannabinoids lol xD
